<title>HUNGARY: C.EUROPE'S CESI DROPS TO 1,383.88 POINTS.</title>
<headline>C.EUROPE'S CESI DROPS TO 1,383.88 POINTS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index dropped on Monday to close at 1,383.88 points, down 7.14 points or 0.51 percent, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, reflects trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
